title: "local_clonecategory: Advanced Category & Course Tree Duplication Plugin for Moodle"
abstract: "A Moodle local plugin for background category and course hierarchy duplication, scoped copy modes, explicit pause and retry, change-detecting rollback protection and a production-path benchmark with recorded evidence limits."
